      "type": "<header>\n  <h1>小森烘焙</h1>\n</header>\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <h2>每天早上七點出爐</h2>\n</section>\n<div class=\"cards\">\n  <div class=\"card\">鄉村麵包 $120</div>\n  <div class=\"card\">可頌 $65</div>\n  <div class=\"card\">肉桂捲 $80</div>\n</div>",
      "chapter": "HTML：網頁的骨架",
      "narration": "先學 HTML，用一個個標籤，寫出網頁上有哪些東西：店名、標語，還有商品。",
      "focus": false
